.MARINE...
(Today through Wednesday)
Issued at 853 AM PDT Fri Sep 25 2026

A passing dry cold front will bring fresh to strong northerly
breezes into the weekend. Near gale force gusts are possible
across Monterey Bay south to Big Sur through Sunday afternoon and
evening. Tropical storm activity producing long period southerly
swell begins to increase for the beginning of next week.

